  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender-AGI - Adolescent Girls Initiati</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gender-AGI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">6. Sida has been directed by the govt to fund AGI through the         Strategy for Global Dev. AGI is part of the World Bank Gender Action  Plan. AGI aims to smooth the transition from school to productive     employment for girls and women (age 16-24) by helping them complete   education, build skills matching market demand and offer incentives   for empolyser to hire, retrain and train them. Implemented in Rwanda.</narrative>
